# Nemotron-3.5-Bolt-E4B with an 8k context window for the stock-scoring pipeline.
#
# WHY: Ollama's default context is 4096 tokens. The agent prompts (Fundamental ~4.8k, Industry ~3.7k) plus their
# JSON answer do not fit in 4096, so calls 400 ("exceeds the available context size") or get truncated
# (LengthFinishReasonError). 8192 holds the prompt and leaves room for the reply.
#
# You usually do NOT need this file: the app now requests num_ctx=8192 per call (OLLAMA_NUM_CTX), which recent
# Ollama honours. Use this (or OLLAMA_CONTEXT_LENGTH) only if your Ollama ignores the per-request option.
#
# BUILD:
#   ollama create nemotron-e4b-8k -f app/config/ollama/nemotron-e4b-8k.Modelfile
#   # then set this name in app/service/models/model_config.json
#
# A 4B model at 8k context is light enough for a MacBook Air. Raise num_ctx if your prompts grow.

FROM hf.co/abenzerps/Nemotron-3.5-Bolt-E4B-GSQ-RCO-GGUF:Q5_K_M

PARAMETER num_ctx 8192
PARAMETER num_predict 2000
